  Message: "Governor, some engineers are keen to take the journey to the volcano
    in order to investigate its condition. This might help them estimate the time
    left until the eruption, but they need resources for the trek. The people are
    desperate for answers so it would be very unwise to deny the engineers' request.\_\n"
